  "title": "Egg and Sausage Casserole",
  "description": "This egg and sausage casserole is ideal for a weekend breakfast, and it’s simple to make with eggs, sausage, crescent roll dough, and two types of cheese!",
  "authors": [
    "LeAnn"
  ],
